ssigned strictly where backed by retrieved documentation, while functional types (AI, Develop, Design, Study/Research, Traditional, SEO/Audit Tool, SMM Tool) are explicitly split between verified descriptions and slug-inferred classifications.1. Input Hygiene, Deduplication, and Non-Repository URLsNormalizing the 507 raw lines removes 85 redundant line occurrences spanning 65 repeated URLs (64 under Farhan's handles and element-hq/element-web among third-party links) and isolates 6 non-repository links. Although Farhan's curriculum vitae documents also cite github.com/FarhanSabit, github.com/FarhanSab, and github.com/FarhanSabit-OITS, none of the 416 repository URLs use those three account handles.Inventory SegmentCountDetails and Representative EntriesRaw Input Lines507Total non-empty lines in the submitted list.Duplicate Line Occurrences85Across 65 unique URLs: 2 appear 4× (farhantahmid-proit/supervision, farhantahmid-proit/komi-learn); 16 appear 3× (claude-bug-bounty, croc, vllm, Agents, DEMOITS-POC/LEANN, Sana, OpenHands, OmniVoice-Studio, langroid, core, sentence-transformers, onyx, osmedeus, UI-TARS-desktop, deep-research, olmocr); 47 appear 2× (46 Farhan-handle links and element-hq/element-web).Unique URLs422Complete deduplicated link inventory.Non-GitHub URLs3teamily.ai (with Google Ads tracking parameters), codata.io (with UTM/Google Ads parameters), and developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/agents (OpenAI Agents guide).GitHub Non-Repository URLs3github.com/feed (user feed), github.com/frappe-pr-bot (user/bot profile path), and github.com/fts-pro?page=16&tab=repositories (org pagination query).Farhan Handle Repositories346farhantahmid-proit (174), fts-pro (164), DEMOITS-POC (8) — 262 unique repository names plus 84 cross-handle mirrors.Third-Party Handle Repositories70External repositories across 61 distinct owners (anomalyco: 5; zyno-io: 4; vercel-labs: 2; KhaiTrang1995: 2; 57 single-repo owners).2. Handle Partitioning and Fork LineageBecause GitHub owners